{"id":60525,"date":"2026-08-19T11:12:23","date_gmt":"2026-08-19T10:12:23","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-09-04T17:28:38","modified_gmt":"2026-09-04T16:28:38","slug":"triangle-adventure-by-azores-trail-run","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/triangle-adventure-by-azores-trail-run\/","title":{"rendered":"Azores Triangle Adventure 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Azores Triangle Adventure 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Azores Triangle Adventure 2026<\/strong> realiza-se de <strong>23 a 25 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, percorrendo o m\u00edstico e fascinante Tri\u00e2ngulo dos A\u00e7ores \u2014 as ilhas do <strong>Pico, S\u00e3o Jorge e Faial<\/strong>. Organizada pela conceituada equipa da <strong>Azores Trail Run \/ CIAIA<\/strong> com apoio do Governo Regional dos A\u00e7ores e dos munic\u00edpios locais, a prova \u00e9 uma das experi\u00eancias de trail running por etapas mais espetaculares, exclusivas e cobi\u00e7adas do panorama internacional.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O desafio totaliza cerca de <strong>95 km e mais de 5000m D+<\/strong> divididos por 3 ilhas vulc\u00e2nicas consecutivas: a <em>Etapa 1 no Pico (30 km)<\/em> subindo das vinhas patrim\u00f3nio da UNESCO \u00e0 imponente Montanha do Pico; a <em>Etapa 2 em S\u00e3o Jorge (31 km)<\/em> pelas m\u00edticas faj\u00e3s e arribas oce\u00e2nicas; e a <em>Etapa 3 no Faial (33 km)<\/em> pela monumental Caldeira e paisagem lunar do Vulc\u00e3o dos Capelinhos. O pacote do evento inclui passagens de barco entre ilhas, transporte de bagagens, refei\u00e7\u00f5es, cronometragem chip Stop and Go e a lend\u00e1ria medalha de finalista.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">23 a 25 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li 