ning<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Etapa 3 &#8211; Trilho dos Vulc\u00f5es (Faial)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 25 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 11:30 \u2022 1400m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">Inclu\u00eddo no pacote global<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o formato do Azores Triangle Adventure 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento decorre de 23 a 25 de outubro de 2026, disputado num formato de 3 etapas consecutivas em 3 ilhas distintas dos A\u00e7ores.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as 3 etapas que constituem a prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Etapa 1 no Pico (30 km \/ subida \u00e0 montanha), Etapa 2 em S\u00e3o Jorge (31 km \/ trilho das faj\u00e3s) e Etapa 3 no Faial (33 km \/ vulc\u00f5es e Capelinhos).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona a log\u00edstica e transportes entre ilhas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui as liga\u00e7\u00f5es mar\u00edtimas de barco entre as ilhas do tri\u00e2ngulo, transferes de autocarro para as partidas e transporte di\u00e1rio de bagagem.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o global no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Inclui dorsal com chip, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, viagens mar\u00edtimas regulares da prova, transferes terrestres, abastecimentos, jantar final e medalha finisher.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso formalizar a minha inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais realizam-se no site oficial da Azores Trail Run \/ Stop and Go atrav\u00e9s do link disponibilizado no Portugal Running.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Azores Triangle Adventure 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-23\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Ilhas do Pico, S\u00e3o Jorge e Faial, A\u00e7ores\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Horta\", \"addressRegion\": \"A\u00e7ores\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Azores Trail Run e CIAIA\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o formato do Azores Triangle Adventure 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento decorre de 23 a 25 de outubro de 2026, disputado num formato de 3 etapas consecutivas em 3 ilhas distintas dos A\u00e7ores.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as 3 etapas que constituem a prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Etapa 1 no Pico (30 km \/ subida \u00e0 montanha), Etapa 2 em S\u00e3o Jorge (31 km \/ trilho das faj\u00e3s) e Etapa 3 no Faial (33 km \/ vulc\u00f5es e Capelinhos).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona a log\u00edstica e transportes entre ilhas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui as liga\u00e7\u00f5es mar\u00edtimas de barco entre as ilhas do tri\u00e2ngulo, transferes de autocarro para as partidas e transporte di\u00e1rio de bagagem.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o global no evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Inclui dorsal com chip, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, viagens mar\u00edtimas regulares da prova, transferes terrestres, abastecimentos, jantar final e medalha finisher.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso formalizar a minha inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais realizam-se no site oficial da Azores Trail Run \/ Stop and Go atrav\u00e9s do link disponibilizado no Portugal Running.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66826,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,498],"event_type_2":[104,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[823],"class_list":["post-60525","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-acores","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-acores","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_5-circuito-atrp"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/triangle-adventure-by-azores-trail-run-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/60525","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.